  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5802.17 Quick Screen",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5802.17 “Quick Screen” means the process by which a subject vehicle initially selected for pullover may be exempted from the full SAE J1667 test procedure by performing two “snaps” of the accelerator pedal and displaying no visible black smoke.\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
